   "install": {
    "title": "Getting Started",
    "html": "<p>This course has 21 lessons. Each lesson covers its own topic so start wherever you like!</p>\n<p>Lessons are labeled either \"Learn\" lessons explaining a Generative AI concept or \"Build\" lessons that explain a concept and code examples in both <strong>Python</strong> and <strong>TypeScript</strong> when possible.</p>\n<p>For .NET Developers checkout <a href=\"https://github.com/microsoft/Generative-AI-for-beginners-dotnet?WT.mc_id=academic-105485-koreyst\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Generative AI for Beginners (.NET Edition)</a>!</p>\n<p>Each lesson also includes a \"Keep Learning\" section with additional learning tools.</p>",
